OL,3,GNEWSATrial date set for man accused of
OL,4,Aasylum hotel stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA provisional trial date has been set
OL,7,Ffor a man accused of trying to murder a
OL,8,Fwelfare officer at a hotel housing
OL,9,Fasylum seekers.
OL,11,FAbdifatah Yusuf Adani allegedly stabbed
OL,12,Fthe staff member five times with a
OL,13,Flarge kitchen knife at the Stanwell
OL,14,FHotel in Surrey last month.
OL,16,FThe 22-year-old Somali national
OL,17,Fappeared at Guildford Crown Court on
OL,18,FThursday, but was not asked to enter a
OL,19,Fplea.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
